#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:5
#: a6c43d209f63409586690f327598d2bd
msgid "Funding Committee"
msgstr "资金委员会"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:7
#: e7e632b507c74a9d90bb4129156b7c2f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot collects funds through donations from :ref:`individuals "
"<common-donation>` and `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ and these are held within SPI "
"and the ArduPilot Foundation. Some of these funds go to pay for fixed "
"costs including servers (i.e. build servers, wiki servers, etc) and are "
"billed directly to ArduPilot's account within SPI. Other project expenses"
" and support engineer compensation is paid from the ArduPilot Foundation "
"account."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过 :ref:`个人捐款 <common-donation>` 和 `合作伙伴 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ 筹集资金，资金由 SPI 和 ArduPilot "
"基金会持有。部分资金用于支付固定成本（包括构建服务器、Wiki 服务器等），直接从 ArduPilot 在 SPI "
"的账户中扣除。其他项目支出和支持工程师薪酬则从 ArduPilot 基金会账户中支付。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:10
#: 695b23b0f74a4bccb6bc2b6889cae706
msgid ""
"The rules governing the Fundinng committee are setforth here: `Funding "
"Committee Rules "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l6M5fxjoLEv4TQYzvZhbcBYsUlxJOXSIEfELrACp6f8/edit?usp=sharing>`__."
msgstr ""
"资金委员会的管理规则详见：`资金委员会规则 "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l6M5fxjoLEv4TQYzvZhbcBYsUlxJOXSIEfELrACp6f8/edit?usp=sharing>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:12
#: 6f77611b15ce4af39574e1f3096fd03b
msgid ""
"Each month SPI publishes an in-month and year-to-date financial report on"
" the Treasurer `page <https://spi-inc.org/treasurer/>`__.  Annual "
"Reports, containing a high level summary, are published `here <https"
"://spi-inc.org/corporate/annual-reports/>`__"
msgstr ""
"SPI 每月在财务 `页面 <https://spi-inc.org/treasurer/>`__ "
"发布当月及年初至今的财务报告。包含高层摘要的年度报告发布于 `此处 <https://spi-inc.org/corporate/annual-"
"reports/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:14
#: 4c0e1743938a4d9ea5c8e273581080e4
msgid "This page attempts to outline how ArduPilot Project funds are managed."
msgstr "本页旨在概述 ArduPilot 项目资金的管理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:17
#: 9ffe12015769458c931050ed39794d76
msgid "Submitting Proposals"
msgstr "提交提案"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:19
#: d48ba71a4aa041ac9d96b6f0f65f086e
msgid ""
"Anyone may submit a proposal to receive funding by opening a new topic "
"within the `Discuss Forum's Proposal category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__. Suggestions for what the "
"proposal should include are described `here "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/about-the-funding-proposals-"
"category/12255>`__ and also copied below:"
msgstr ""
"任何人均可在 `讨论论坛的提案分类 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__ "
"中发起新主题以提交资金申请。提案应包含的内容建议详见 `此处 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/about-"
"the-funding-proposals-category/12255>`__，以下也有转载："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:22
#: 70a1b8c8c71943b98be728558f6835f4
msgid "Proposals should be no more than 2 pages and include:"
msgstr "提案不超过 2 页，应包含："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:24
#: 33e358b83cee40b8b595f1cfbd26fb57
msgid "description of the project and how it would improve ArduPilot"
msgstr "项目描述及其如何改进 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:25
#: 59c5b55037e044fea56cce4a76f182bd
msgid "how much money is needed"
msgstr "所需资金金额"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:26
#: cb998ac9a3ec4c73a8b946c25aa87875
msgid "what resources are needed (hardware, software, time)"
msgstr "所需资源（硬件、软件、时间）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:27
#: 4ea93a3be8f9464f8655400a7e543b91
msgid "what core developer support is required (if any)"
msgstr "所需的核心开发者支持（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:28
#: 096cb906ce5a4249a75f3268671fa1e8
msgid ""
"timespan for the completion of the project (and milestones if longer than"
" 3 months)"
msgstr "项目完成时间跨度（超过 3 个月时需列明里程碑）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:29
#: 178299c14ab543e7b45d569303f21b93
msgid ""
"what skills the developer has to complete the task (i.e. past experience "
"contributing to ArduPilot)"
msgstr "开发者完成任务所具备的技能（即向 ArduPilot 贡献的过往经验）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:31
#: 35d25d0e77044204aceb642a75c2878d
msgid ""
"All proposal submissions are considered public information, and may be "
"disclosed to whatever audience is relevant at the time, such as developer"
" or partner meetings and group calls, and may be published on the website"
" or forums."
msgstr "所有提案均视为公开信息，可向相关受众披露，例如开发者或合作伙伴会议及群组通话，也可发布在网站或论坛上。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:33
#: 23aa0e26400c4da0b71827b88e193f9c
msgid ""
"After posting the proposal, ping the Funding Committee in the dev-team-"
"funding channel on Discord with a link to the proposal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:36
#: 8b1aea8fcf9f4abca097119decf00c93
msgid "Evaluating Proposals"
msgstr "评估提案"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:38
#: 974741cc97504b0183641e5c91b1537e
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot funding committee is made up of three elected members from "
"the team with elections held each December.  The currently elected "
"members are:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 资金委员会由每年 12 月选举产生的三名团队成员组成。目前当选成员为："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:40
#: 39fbe7302dca4fada3d5100a403b1b1c
msgid "Andrew Tridgell"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:41
#: ce77f93308004d9295fa2b3d2fda2a16
msgid "James Pattison"
msgstr "James Pattison"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:42
#: 9762920e06e94383b20967065abc4d40
msgid "Andy Piper"
msgstr "Andy Piper"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:44
#: b01b8895947c4e5e96ed5c8e6f97b869
msgid ""
"This committee reviews the `Proposal category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__ regularly and evaluates "
"proposals based on both the benefit to ArduPilot and likelihood of "
"success. The approve/reject decision is made by a simple majority vote "
"(i.e. 2 of 3 must approve)."
msgstr ""
"该委员会定期审查 `提案分类 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__，并根据对 "
"ArduPilot 的益处和成功可能性评估提案。批准/拒绝决定通过简单多数表决做出（即 3 票中至少 2 票同意）。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:47
#: 5266da64362045be9b4da4f6ad058ea1
msgid ""
"The committee has authority to decide on its own for funding requests up "
"to $2000.  Above this, if the funding committee approves of the request, "
"a member of the funding committee should raise a vote for the wider dev "
"team to decide on the proposal."
msgstr "委员会有权自行决定不超过 2000 美元的资金申请。超过此金额时，若资金委员会批准该申请，应由委员会成员发起投票，由更广泛的开发团队对提案作出决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:49
#: 84b02c508df34c199999be76e54e3cbb
msgid "Additional guidance:"
msgstr "额外指导意见："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:51
#: f4dcfa4056f543c48a8190580ae3b6f4
msgid ""
"requests for small amounts of funding (eg. $200 to buy a new sensor) "
"generally have a very low threshold for funding. Larger requests receive "
"more scrutiny."
msgstr "小额资金申请（例如 200 美元购买新传感器）通常门槛很低。较大的申请将受到更严格的审查。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:52
#: f3099b441cef48cf91029d844aa1336c
msgid ""
"for larger requests (i.e. over $2000) the committee may ask the applicant"
" to undertake a smaller sub-task first to demonstrate their ability to "
"take on the larger task."
msgstr "对于较大的申请（超过 2000 美元），委员会可能会要求申请人先完成较小的子任务，以证明其承担更大任务的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:53
#: fdc97c60f3264cf4b1ca197cc8a6542a
msgid ""
"specific proposals are favored over less specific ones. For example, a "
"proposal to “improve ArduPilot” would be less likely to be funded "
"compared with a proposal to “add support for the XYZ gyroscope”."
msgstr "具体的提案比模糊的提案更受青睐。例如，「增加对 XYZ 陀螺仪的支持」的提案比「改进 ArduPilot」的提案更有可能获得资助。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:54
#: 049c7d01116b46c2a2dd95712813b218
msgid ""
"we should keep red-tape to a minimum. There is no point in there being 10"
" hours of admin for a $200 request. Small proposals should be encouraged "
"which are just a few paragraphs, and the person should get their money "
"quickly and with a minimum of fuss."
msgstr "应将繁文缛节降至最低。对于 200 美元的申请，花费 10 小时行政处理毫无意义。应鼓励只需几段话的小型提案，申请人应能快速、简便地获得资金。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:55
#: dd13d103014643bc856b71bfd1efd82f
msgid ""
"all proposals should receive and accepted or rejected response within a "
"reasonable amount of time."
msgstr "所有提案应在合理时间内收到批准或拒绝的回复。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:58
#: f28bf0b09b6d4d1f89b69763c127c6ad
msgid "Getting Paid"
msgstr "获得付款"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:60
#: a5d9e18b14a74e9889fcc6eada36ae81
#, fuzzy
msgid "Payments from ArduPilot are made via PayPal:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 的付款方式有两种："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:62
#: 935722ffc4eb4961b16394410f4f2bbb
msgid ""
"Email the receipts to funding@ardupilot.org, with a clear subject title "
"linking it back to the original funding proposal. In the case of multiple"
" receipts, collate them into a single email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:63
#: b3ec09b6abda41ae857391a185d969a2
msgid ""
"Send a request for funds to ardupilot.devel@gmail.com. The request "
"description must have a clear reference back to the original funding "
"proposal"
msgstr ""

